WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.135
Mexican authorities

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:02.936
just arrested

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:05.271
five more people linked to the killing

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.307
and kidnaping of American tourists

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.041
and the cartel

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.676
and investigators believe is responsible

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.310
for the crimes.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.678
Is now apologizing

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.246
to the victim's families.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.415
The Gulf cartel also handed over

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.517
five of its members to local authorities.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.019
Now the bodies of trade.

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:20.520
Woodard and Jane Doe Brown,

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.022
the two Americans killed in

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:22.856
that kidnaping

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.524
have been delivered to U.S.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.892
diplomatic authorities.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.494
The group of friends from South Carolina

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:28.561
drove to Matamoros,

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:29.996
Mexico, last Friday,

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:31.064
so one of them could get

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.399
a medical procedure.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:34.200
Investigators believe they were mistaken

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.402
for drug smugglers.

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:36.536
CNN security correspondent

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.071
Josh Campbell joins us now.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.806
And Josh, this apology letter,

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.841
it seems highly unusual.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:43.576
What more are you learning about

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:44.411
how it came about?

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:46.679
Yeah, be honest.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:47.580
Days after

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.181
the kidnaping

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.616
of these four American citizens,

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:50.717
in Mexico,

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.986
the cartel that is suspected to be behind

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.254
this appears to be doing

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:55.755
some PR image cleanup,

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.624
of course, cartel known for its violence,

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.125
known for its brutality.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.461
But yesterday, this letter surfaced.

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:02.996
The so-called apology letter now

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:04.964
obtained a copy from a sources

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.466
familiar with this investigation.

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:07.400
I'll read you part of it.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.268
It says that

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.470
the Gulf cartel apologizes

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.205
to the society of Matamoros.

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:13.773
The relatives of Miss O'Reilly,

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:14.874
that was a Mexican national

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:16.242
who was killed in this attack.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:16.910
And the affected

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.311
American people and families,

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.179
it goes on to say, the Gulf

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:20.580
Cartel Scorpion Group

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.781
strongly condemns

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.183
the events of last Friday.

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:23.883
For this reason,

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.051
we decided to hand over

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.319
those directly involved

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.455
and responsible for the acts.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:29.689
Now it's worth pointing out

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.124
that the source that I spoke

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.225
with said that U.S.

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:33.426
and Mexican law enforcement,

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.995
they doubt the sincerity of this apology.

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:36.196
Again,

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:37.864
it appears to be said

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:38.665
in response

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:39.799
to all the attention

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.701
that has come upon this group,

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:42.602
of course, we have U.S.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.304
officials who have been demanding

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:45.271
that the US government

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.473
do more to help

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:47.974
try to curb some of the violence

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:49.442
at the US-Mexico border.

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.043
So again,

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.578
the sincerity of that letter

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:53.146
is certainly in question.

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:54.848
But they mentioned as part of that letter

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:56.049
that they handed over

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.283
members of their group.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:58.852
There was a photo that surfaced online

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.787
showing five men on the pavement,

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:02.889
their shirts pulled over their heads.

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:03.823
We could not confirm that

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:05.091
that was an actual

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:06.259
those were actually part

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:07.393
of this incident.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:08.728
But the Mexican officials

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:10.296
today announced that they have arrested

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.631
five people.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.299
That was a mug shot that you just saw.

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.234
Again, still unclear

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:16.336
what their exact alleged role was here.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:16.836
But, of course,

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:18.838
the families of those who were kidnaped

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:20.473
particularly those who were killed

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.208
in that attack, are demanding justice.

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:22.775
In fact,

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.277
our colleague Carlos Suarez

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.044
spoke to

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:25.678
the mother

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.280
of one of the surviving members,

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.015
and she wants to see law enforcement

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:30.350
go forcefully after this

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:30.917
group, telling

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:32.152
Carlos that they need

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:33.253
to keep getting them

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:34.721
until they get them all guys.

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:36.823
Now, I mentioned

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:38.791
that the bodies of Shade Woodard

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:39.859
and Jane Doe Brown,

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:41.694
those are now with us

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.330
diplomatic authorities where officials.

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:46.599
What happens next?

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:47.333
Yeah.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.202
So those remains were repatriated

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:50.203
back to the United States.

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:50.937
A source familiar

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.539
with this process tells me that

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:53.873
there will now be a second

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:55.308
autopsy that's conducted.

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:56.476
There was an autopsy conducted

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.377
by Mexican officials.

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:57.710
Of course,

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:58.444
this crime

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:00.079
occurred in their jurisdiction.

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:01.047
But this is interesting

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.248
and I think signals for us

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:03.950
where the FBI investigation is

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.584
going, U.S.

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:05.585
authorities are going

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:07.253
to conduct their own autopsies.

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:08.221
I can tell you, having worked

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:10.456
these murder cases in the past overseas,

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:11.925
that when the FBI is building

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:12.425
a case

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:14.194
for possible prosecution,

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:15.161
they would like, you know,

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:17.597
for basically for simplicity and ease

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.032
to have an American doctor

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:20.133
conduct an autopsy

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.467
so they have their own results.

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:23.036
And then that person could be easily

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.003
called to testify

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:25.672
if there is an eventual prosecution

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:26.606
and extradition.

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:28.708
So a lot going on behind the scenes

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:30.076
as authorities both on the U.S.

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:32.078
and Mexican side try to investigate

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:33.012
those who are responsible

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:34.614
for this brutal, brutal attack us.

